<template>
<main node-id="lives" class="lives" lang="zh-CN">
 <header node-id="masthead" class="masthead"><span node-id="brand" class="brand">Atria</span><span node-id="book-title">开放生活志</span><button node-id="refresh" class="quiet">重新读取</button></header>
 <p node-id="loading" if="component.loading" class="feedback" role="status">正在读取你的故事…</p>
 <p node-id="error" if="component.error" class="feedback error" role="alert" bind:text="component.error"/>
 <p node-id="notice" if="component.notice" class="feedback" role="status" bind:text="component.notice"/>
 <section node-id="entry" if="component.entry" class="entry sheet"><div node-id="seal" class="seal" aria-hidden="true">A</div><h1 node-id="entry-title">在这座城，<br node-id="entry-break"/>开始你的生活。</h1><p node-id="entry-copy" class="prose">一份短工，一个尚未兑现的承诺，或一件无法解释的小事。你的故事从普通生活开始，往后如何，由你书写。</p><button node-id="newStory" class="primary" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled">新故事</button><p node-id="entry-note" class="muted">先选择境况，再读开篇。此刻无需等待生成。</p></section>
 <section node-id="creation" if="component.creation" class="creation sheet" aria-labelledby="question-heading">
  <p node-id="step-label" class="muted" bind:text="component.stepText"/><h1 node-id="question-heading" tabindex="-1" bind:text="component.question"/>
  <div node-id="identity" if="component.identityStep"><label node-id="name-label" for="name">你希望被怎样称呼？</label><textarea node-id="name" id="name" rows="1" bind:value="component.name" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled" autocomplete="off"/><label node-id="appearance-label" for="appearance">外观或态度，可留空</label><textarea node-id="appearance" id="appearance" rows="3" bind:value="component.appearance" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled" aria-describedby="identity-boundary"/><p node-id="identity-boundary" id="identity-boundary" class="muted">1–48 字称呼，最多 160 字个人修饰。角色均为成年人；个人描述不会赋予财富、官职、他人关系或力量。</p><h2 node-id="mode-heading">这段人生如何保存？</h2><div node-id="modes" class="options"><button node-id="ordinary" value="ordinary" class="choice" bind:aria-current="component.ordinarySelected" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled"><strong node-id="ordinary-label">普通模式</strong><span node-id="ordinary-copy">可以保存并明确恢复较早的经历。死亡后可选择旧保存。</span></button><button node-id="ironman" value="ironman" class="choice" bind:aria-current="component.ironmanSelected" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled"><strong node-id="ironman-label">铁人模式</strong><span node-id="ironman-copy">只续接当前进度，不能回退。规则确认死亡后，宿主清理本局保存；此选择开始后不可更改。</span></button></div></div>
  <div node-id="question-options" if="component.questionStep" class="options"><button node-id="choose" on:click="choose" each="component.options" item-key="id" class="choice"  bind:aria-current="item.selected" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled"><strong node-id="option-label" bind:text="item.label"/><span node-id="option-text" bind:text="item.text"/></button></div>
  <div node-id="review" if="component.reviewStep"><p node-id="review-copy" class="prose" bind:text="component.review"/><p node-id="review-note" class="muted">以上为待确认的境况。开始后将从已建立的角色资料读取开篇与资源。</p><button node-id="begin" class="primary" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled">确认，开始生活</button></div>
  <div node-id="question-controls" class="button-row"><button node-id="previous" if="component.previous" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled">返回修改</button><button node-id="next" if="component.identityStep" class="primary" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled">继续</button><button node-id="nextQuestion" if="component.questionStep" class="primary" bind:disabled="component.writeDisabled">继续</button></div>
  <button node-id="retryBegin" if="component.startRetry" class="primary" bind:disabled="component.busy">重试原确认</button>
 </section>
 <section node-id="story" if="component.story" class="story">
  <header node-id="scene" class="scene"><div node-id="scene-context"><h1 node-id="location" bind:text="component.location"/><p node-id="scene-time" class="muted" bind:text="component.time"/></div><button node-id="openCompanion" on:click="openCompanion" class="quiet" aria-haspopup="dialog">随身记事</button></header>
  <details node-id="background" class="background"><summary node-id="background-label">你从这里开始</summary><p node-id="background-text" class="prose" bind:text="component.background"/></details>
  <section node-id="story-stream" class="story-stream" aria-label="故事与言行"><article node-id="message" each="component.messages" item-key="id" bind:class="item.kind"><p node-id="message-role" class="muted" bind:text="item.role"/><p node-id="message-text" class="prose" bind:text="item.text"/></article><button node-id="nextMessages" if="component.nextMessages" class="quiet">阅读更早故事</button><button node-id="latestMessages" if="component.latestAvailable" class="quiet">回到最新故事</button></section>
  <section node-id="episode" if="component.episodeClosed" class="episode"><h2 node-id="episode-title">这一段经历，暂告一段落。</h2><p node-id="episode-copy">关系与义务仍会延续。你可以保存这段经历，或写下继续生活的打算。</p></section>
  <section node-id="terminal" if="component.terminal" class="terminal" aria-labelledby="terminal-title"><h2 node-id="terminal-title">这一生，已到终点。</h2><p node-id="terminal-text" class="prose" bind:text="component.terminalText"/><button node-id="exit" class="quiet">返回故事列表</button></section>
  <section node-id="composer" if="component.story" class="composer"><div node-id="suggestions" class="suggestions"><button node-id="suggest" on:click="suggest" each="component.suggestions" item-key="id" class="chip"  bind:text="item.label" bind:disabled="component.sendDisabled"/></div><label node-id="draft-label" for="draft">写下你的言行</label><textarea node-id="draft" id="draft" rows="3" bind:value="component.draft" bind:disabled="component.sendDisabled" placeholder="你想说什么，或试着做什么？" aria-describedby="composer-note"/><div node-id="composer-controls" class="button-row"><p node-id="composer-note" id="composer-note" class="muted">建议只填草稿。一次回应处理一个行动，随后再由你决定。</p><button node-id="send" class="primary" bind:disabled="component.sendDisabled">发送</button><button node-id="stop" if="component.busy" class="quiet">停止生成</button></div><div node-id="unknown" if="component.uncertain" class="feedback"><p node-id="unknown-copy">尚未确认结果。草稿仍在，请先读取故事或恢复宿主状态，再决定下一步。</p><button node-id="recover" class="quiet">恢复宿主状态</button></div></section>
 </section>
</main>
</template>
